{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach, grab and process object if in range or approach and take if visible. Scan if not found. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    />\"",
